1
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:29,380
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,960
[Episode 19]

3
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:40,710
Manager Qing Yuan.

4
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,360
I brought you some fruit.

5
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:43,890
Long time no see.

6
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,210
Princess Ningjia.

7
00:01:24,070 --> 00:01:24,710
Qiu.

8
00:01:26,230 --> 00:01:26,920
Qiu.

9
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:33,280
Qiu.

10
00:01:41,310 --> 00:01:42,310
Answer the phone.

11
00:01:43,190 --> 00:01:44,190
Answer the phone!

12
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:49,770
I brought you some files
about people who live forever.

13
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:52,800
What's wrong?

14
00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:54,789
Qiu is in danger.

15
00:02:33,470 --> 00:02:34,430
You're awake.

16
00:02:44,050 --> 00:02:45,210
Does your head hurt?

17
00:02:46,390 --> 00:02:47,520
Are you still dizzy?

18
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,910
Has it been a long time

19
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:54,430
since you felt your life slipping away?

20
00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:02,820
You will keep bleeding.

21
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:09,650
Ning Changyue will
catch a cold and get sick.

22
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:13,580
So falling in love really can
undo the Vow to Live Forever.

23
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:16,280
Princess Ningjia can live forever,

24
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:18,079
as long as the heavens.

25
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,490
Yet you gave it all up

26
00:03:24,940 --> 00:03:25,740
for a guard.

27
00:03:31,310 --> 00:03:33,470
Since you don't cherish it,

28
00:03:33,750 --> 00:03:35,430
I'll grant your wish.

29
00:03:37,750 --> 00:03:38,400
This

30
00:03:39,750 --> 00:03:42,150
is the palace dungeon
from 3,000 years ago,

31
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:50,590
the place you and that guard

32
00:03:50,590 --> 00:03:52,590
desperately wanted to leave.

33
00:03:58,600 --> 00:03:59,600
How about this?

34
00:04:01,190 --> 00:04:03,430
I'll bury you here today.

35
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:04,840
Okay?

36
00:04:06,110 --> 00:04:07,550
Who exactly are you?

37
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:19,000
Servant Liu Yi

38
00:04:19,589 --> 00:04:21,640
pays respects to Your Highness,

39
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:25,740
Princess Ningjia.

40
00:04:34,310 --> 00:04:36,670
No wonder we could never find you.

41
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:39,320
I don't know what dark magic you used

42
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,560
to turn yourself into such a lingering

43
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:44,430
half-human, half-ghost monster.

44
00:04:45,159 --> 00:04:47,310
Monster?

45
00:04:49,409 --> 00:04:50,760
Aren't you the same?

46
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:56,159
Do you think all methods of living forever

47
00:04:56,159 --> 00:04:57,720
are as easy and costless

48
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,920
as yours?

49
00:04:59,810 --> 00:05:01,040
I relied on the vengeful spirits

50
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:03,700
of all the dead medicine slaves
in Southern Qin,

51
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:06,750
suffering the pain of shedding my skin
and being reborn every hundred years

52
00:05:06,750 --> 00:05:09,240
just to barely survive. Yet you…

53
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:12,560
You thief who stole
the Tree Spirit of Immortality.

54
00:05:13,190 --> 00:05:15,360
You enjoy its blessings,

55
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:18,780
yet you squander the power
of living forever like this.

56
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,400
What does our vow to live forever

57
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,190
have to do with you?

58
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:28,050
What does it have to do with me?

59
00:05:32,420 --> 00:05:34,870
What do you mean by
"What does it have to do with me"?

60
00:05:34,870 --> 00:05:35,830
It was me

61
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:39,750
who searched through all the ancient texts
and visited all the famous mountains.

62
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:43,630
It was me who tested the blood
of all the medicine slaves.

63
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:44,830
It was also me

64
00:05:44,830 --> 00:05:46,870
who had General Yu lock up the Tree Spirit

65
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:48,390
in the darksteel cage.

66
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,640
Once the elixir was refined,

67
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:56,900
I would have taken it
before that cursed emperor

68
00:05:57,270 --> 00:06:00,000
to achieve an immortal
and indestructible body.

69
00:06:02,980 --> 00:06:05,220
My plan was flawless.

70
00:06:06,030 --> 00:06:07,390
It was you.

71
00:06:09,310 --> 00:06:10,680
It was you

72
00:06:11,310 --> 00:06:13,630
who ruined everything!

73
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,630
Answer the phone.

74
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,970
Okay, thank you.

75
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,240
The auction house said,

76
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,160
next, they'll send over

77
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,720
all the information of Qing Yuan.

78
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:33,120
We'll definitely find a way
to locate them.

79
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,400
Where are you?

80
00:06:35,630 --> 00:06:36,950
Why didn't you answer the phone?

81
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:38,159
Guard Ning,

82
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,050
I hope you've been well.

83
00:06:41,870 --> 00:06:42,470
Actually,

84
00:06:43,390 --> 00:06:44,560
Mr. Ning,

85
00:06:45,270 --> 00:06:47,800
are you looking for
any collectibles lately?

86
00:06:51,390 --> 00:06:52,240
Let Qiu go.

87
00:06:52,810 --> 00:06:54,409
If you want someone, take me.

88
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,070
It's been 3,000 years.

89
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:59,920
You're still so self-righteous.

90
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,190
Your princess

91
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:06,340
is enjoying the mortal cycle
of birth, aging, illness, and death.

92
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,310
But what a pity.

93
00:07:09,270 --> 00:07:11,600
Her stolen blood of immortality

94
00:07:12,100 --> 00:07:14,430
doesn't seem to withstand much bleeding.

95
00:07:15,310 --> 00:07:16,510
In just a short while,

96
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:19,390
her face turned as pale as paper.

97
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,000
Your Highness,

98
00:07:21,510 --> 00:07:22,910
do you have any last words

99
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,720
for your beloved guard?

100
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:28,240
Princess. Guard.

101
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:32,470
Do you really think
this is the Southern Qin palace?

102
00:07:33,290 --> 00:07:35,500
You wretched eunuch.

103
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:38,920
Your Highness,

104
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:41,390
you're as annoying as ever.

105
00:07:44,530 --> 00:07:45,240
But if

106
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:47,750
I make a few cuts on her body,

107
00:07:47,850 --> 00:07:48,940
will she still be

108
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,950
so stubborn?

109
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,159
Don't touch her!

110
00:07:52,159 --> 00:07:53,430
Or I'll make you pay!

111
00:07:54,270 --> 00:07:55,000
What?

112
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,920
Want to find her?

113
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:01,310
Don't you long-lived ones

114
00:08:02,170 --> 00:08:05,200
have a way to meet each other quickly?

115
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,630
Once you're dead,

116
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,800
you'll find her soon enough.

117
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:10,830
It's just that

118
00:08:11,450 --> 00:08:14,280
the power of living forever is fading.

119
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:15,860
If you die this time,

120
00:08:15,890 --> 00:08:17,450
you might really die.

121
00:08:17,510 --> 00:08:19,240
No, no.

122
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:21,160
Ning Changyue, no!

123
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,560
Calm down!

124
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,310
Calm down!

125
00:08:28,310 --> 00:08:28,840
Lin Huai.

126
00:08:29,390 --> 00:08:30,120
Listen to me.

127
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:31,160
As long as I die,

128
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,480
she'll appear by my side immediately.

129
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,270
She'll be safe.

130
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:34,480
This is the only way!

131
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,270
Come back!

132
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:37,549
And then what?

133
00:08:38,030 --> 00:08:38,840
You died.

134
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,740
Even if she escapes this time,

135
00:08:40,740 --> 00:08:42,340
can she escape the next time?

136
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,440
Liu Yi just wants to watch you

137
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:46,370
seek your own doom again and again.

138
00:08:47,030 --> 00:08:47,890
Ning Changyue,

139
00:08:48,550 --> 00:08:49,870
think carefully.

140
00:08:50,630 --> 00:08:52,870
You two have been together
for 3,000 years.

141
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:54,200
How many times have you died

142
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,560
and lived together to get to
where you are today?

143
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,890
If you die today,

144
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,600
will Liu Yi let her off?

145
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,150
I'm asking someone

146
00:09:13,150 --> 00:09:14,440
to track the location
of Song Yiqiu's phone,

147
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,440
but it takes time.

148
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:16,930
Think quickly now.

149
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,250
Is there any place that is special

150
00:09:18,250 --> 00:09:19,580
for you and Song Yiqiu?

151
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,750
He has planned this for so long.

152
00:09:20,750 --> 00:09:22,390
He couldn't have just picked
a random place.

153
00:09:22,390 --> 00:09:22,990
Red light!

154
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,690
Where is she?

155
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,260
I must have missed something.

156
00:09:32,540 --> 00:09:35,400
Do you really think
this is the Southern Qin palace?

157
00:09:36,310 --> 00:09:38,190
You wretched eunuch.

158
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:41,670
The Southern Qin palace.

159
00:09:42,710 --> 00:09:43,360
What?

160
00:09:43,380 --> 00:09:45,950
The place where the Vow to Live Forever
and Liu Yi's power began.

161
00:09:45,950 --> 00:09:48,210
It's also the place where our feud began.

162
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,480
After so long,

163
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,360
your Guard Ning

164
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:04,120
hasn't said he would sacrifice his life

165
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,240
to save you.

166
00:10:11,410 --> 00:10:13,770
Then he will never find this place.

167
00:10:14,950 --> 00:10:16,120
What a pity.

168
00:10:20,030 --> 00:10:21,790
Your love

169
00:10:21,790 --> 00:10:24,550
isn't that everlasting after all.

170
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:28,330
So much for loving each other forever.

171
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,790
So much for never parting.

172
00:10:31,750 --> 00:10:32,750
In the end,

173
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:35,280
you only care about yourselves.

174
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:37,360
You're deceiving yourselves.

175
00:10:38,270 --> 00:10:39,440
Love

176
00:10:40,870 --> 00:10:43,030
isn't only real if you die

177
00:10:43,750 --> 00:10:45,120
for each other.

178
00:10:46,270 --> 00:10:47,840
Our love

179
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,860
is just about wanting to live well

180
00:10:51,390 --> 00:10:52,840
with each other.

181
00:11:00,750 --> 00:11:03,630
So what if you've lived
for thousands of years?

182
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:06,340
In the end,

183
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:10,900
you don't understand
the meaning of love at all.

184
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:14,550
This broken immortality of yours

185
00:11:15,790 --> 00:11:18,750
makes you nothing but a walking corpse.

186
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:20,050
What do you know?

187
00:11:20,910 --> 00:11:21,840
I have love.

188
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:25,010
I love my younger sister.

189
00:11:26,030 --> 00:11:27,030
My younger sister

190
00:11:27,430 --> 00:11:29,950
could have lived forever with me.

191
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:31,380
Take this identity token

192
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:32,910
and go out through the west corner gate.

193
00:11:32,910 --> 00:11:35,710
Everything Lord Ning arranged
is still in effect.

194
00:11:36,810 --> 00:11:38,170
Because you two

195
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:41,270
took away the immortality
that belonged to her.

196
00:11:41,270 --> 00:11:42,120
Xiaoyuan.

197
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:49,970
You are Xiaoyuan's older brother.

198
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:55,510
You are actually Xiaoyuan's older brother.

199
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,330
Have mercy, my lord!

200
00:11:57,460 --> 00:11:58,860
I can't leave the palace.

201
00:11:59,150 --> 00:12:00,360
I can't leave!

202
00:12:00,630 --> 00:12:01,490
Your Highness,

203
00:12:01,770 --> 00:12:03,120
I am doing this willingly.

204
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:03,790
I entered the palace

205
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:05,840
to look for my long-lost brother.

206
00:12:06,190 --> 00:12:06,950
For now,

207
00:12:06,970 --> 00:12:08,570
my brother is still missing.

208
00:12:09,270 --> 00:12:10,510
I can't leave.

209
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:11,910
Lord Ning helped me.

210
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,700
His wish is to help you escape the palace.

211
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,720
I will also escape during the chaos.

212
00:12:17,550 --> 00:12:17,960
Hurry.

213
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:18,670
No.

214
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:20,530
Your Highness.

215
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:22,240
After you escape,

216
00:12:22,430 --> 00:12:23,640
the world is vast.

217
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:26,000
Your Highness, I hope

218
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,800
you get what you wish for.

219
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:30,750
I didn't expect

220
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:35,530
that Xiaoyuan was sent by her own brother

221
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:39,270
to be a blood-testing medicine slave.

222
00:12:40,220 --> 00:12:41,650
She could have been free,

223
00:12:42,170 --> 00:12:44,830
but she chose to stay
in the palace voluntarily,

224
00:12:45,830 --> 00:12:47,160
just for…

225
00:12:47,550 --> 00:12:48,270
For…

226
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:51,270
For what?

227
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:52,510
For what?

228
00:12:55,620 --> 00:12:58,280
♪ Always secretly guessing ♪

229
00:12:57,200 --> 00:13:00,200
Just for reuniting with you.

230
00:12:59,610 --> 00:13:06,190
♪ Always wondering who's looking ♪

231
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:03,600
Xiaoyuan came looking for me?

232
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,600
No.

233
00:13:06,470 --> 00:13:11,610
♪ The evil still quietly approaches ♪

234
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:09,090
I didn't mean to kill Xiaoyuan.

235
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,080
I didn't mean to.

236
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,790
It was you

237
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,240
who let the princess go?

238
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,630
You are all sinners.

239
00:13:33,870 --> 00:13:35,440
Give me back

240
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:42,680
my immortality.

241
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,270
Brother.

242
00:13:57,870 --> 00:13:58,910
Xiaoyuan.

243
00:14:14,330 --> 00:14:15,240
What?

244
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:17,120
You killed her?

245
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,840
It was you who killed her!

246
00:14:21,590 --> 00:14:23,070
How could you

247
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:25,730
kill your own sister?

248
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:30,200
She only wanted to reunite with you.

249
00:14:31,530 --> 00:14:34,250
She just wanted to find you.

250
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:35,920
No.

251
00:14:35,940 --> 00:14:37,000
It's not like that.

252
00:14:38,130 --> 00:14:39,440
She deserved to die.

253
00:14:39,910 --> 00:14:41,390
Xiaoyuan deserved to die.

254
00:14:42,070 --> 00:14:44,200
She deserved to die in the first place.

255
00:14:45,090 --> 00:14:46,640
It's all because of you.

256
00:14:47,130 --> 00:14:48,280
It's you.

257
00:14:48,850 --> 00:14:50,570
It's all because of you.

258
00:15:14,970 --> 00:15:17,140
♪ So here is to you ♪

259
00:15:19,570 --> 00:15:22,580
♪ My darling ♪

260
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:26,810
♪ And here is to you ♪

261
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:30,840
♪ My friend ♪

262
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:34,550
♪ Here is to you ♪

263
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:38,360
♪ My lover ♪

264
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:51,950
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

265
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:46,790
Qiu.

266
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:51,670
Here.

267
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:52,600
Slow down.

268
00:15:53,100 --> 00:16:01,660
♪ I'll follow you until ♪

269
00:15:53,910 --> 00:15:54,480
Qiu.

270
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:55,440
Qiu.

271
00:15:56,750 --> 00:15:57,600
Are you okay?

272
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,320
Where did he hurt you?

273
00:15:59,690 --> 00:16:00,730
I'm fine.

274
00:16:01,910 --> 00:16:03,030
Are you okay?

275
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:05,510
I'm fine.

276
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:08,440
Are you okay?

277
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,440
Why wouldn't I be?

278
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:10,600
Here.

279
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:14,120
Let me take a look.

280
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,480
I'm fine.

281
00:16:16,510 --> 00:16:17,440
Qiu.

282
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,720
We are both safe now.

283
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:21,650
Let's go.

284
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:22,440
Let's go home.
